Title: Refactor duplicate string copy logic in msg.c

Message:
Refactor duplicate string copy logic in msg.c

Refactored the duplicate code for generating string properties in `MsgGetProp`
into a new static helper function `msgPropStrGen`. This reduces code duplication
in both the substring extraction and regex matching sections.

The new helper function handles memory allocation (using `CHKmalloc`), copying,
null-termination, and proper management of the `pbMustBeFreed` flag.

With the help of AI-Agents: Jules

Patch:
diff --git a/runtime/msg.c b/runtime/msg.c
